message: "If you use this research, please cite it as below."
title: "RMX1901 Research: Snapdragon 710 boot-chain, EDL and Android privilege-escalation notes"
abstract: >-
  A sanitized research record covering Android runtime privilege escalation,
  Qualcomm EDL/Sahara/Firehose, PBL/XBL/ABL reverse engineering, Realme
  Deep Testing, OPPO K3 firmware compatibility, and device recovery on a
  personally owned Realme X (RMX1901EX, SDM710). The bootloader remains
  locked; no unlock is claimed.
